// Buddy desk unit firmware for ESP32-S3-DevKitC-1 + INMP441 mic + MAX98357A amp.
//
// The code lives in the buddy_main.cpp tab (a plain C++ file, so it builds the same in
// the Arduino IDE and PlatformIO). Settings such as pin numbers are in the config.h tab.
//
// Arduino IDE: install "esp32 by Espressif" 3.x, plus the libraries WebSockets (Markus
// Sattler), WiFiManager (tzapu) and ArduinoJson (Benoit Blanchon).
// Board: "ESP32S3 Dev Module". See buddy/README.md for wiring and setup.
